config RW_MEM
	tristate "rwMem-compatible process memory driver"
	depends on MMU
	help
	  Creates /dev/rwmem and provides cross-process read/write access plus
	  process-map queries through the ri-char/rwMem userspace ABI.

	  Select Y for Android kernels. M is also supported when access_process_vm
	  is exported to vendor modules by the target kernel.
